b1=A.a([new A.aZ("f2l_br_in",l,"R' U' R",""),new A.aZ("f2l_bl_in",b1,"L U L'","")],k)
l=$.c==="en"
j=l?"Recognise OLL/PLL from two sides":"Nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n OLL/PLL ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi 2 m\u1eb7t"
i=l?"Know the case from the front and right sides \u2013 no U turns to peek.":"Nh\xecn m\u1eb7t tr\u01b0\u1edbc v\xe0 m\u1eb7t ph\u1ea3i l\xe0 bi\u1ebft tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p \u2013 kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n xoay U \u0111\u1ec3 xem."
h=l?'PLL: look for "headlights" (2 same-colour corners on a side), a "bar" (3 same-colour stickers), a "checker" (alternating colours), a "block" (corner + edge of the same colour).':'PLL: t\xecm "\u0111\xe8n pha" (2 g\xf3c c\xf9ng m\xe0u \u1edf m\u1ed9t m\u1eb7t), "d\u1ea3i" (3 \xf4 c\xf9ng m\xe0u), "b\xe0n c\u1edd" (m\xe0u xen k\u1ebd), "kh\u1ed1i" (g\xf3c + c\u1ea1nh li\u1ec1n nhau c\xf9ng m\xe0u).'
g=l?"Two adjacent sides tell you every PLL \u2013 practise reading front + right, guess, then check.":"Hai m\u1eb7t k\u1ec1 nhau cho \u0111\u1ee7 th\xf4ng tin cho m\u1ecdi PLL \u2013 t\u1eadp nh\xecn tr\u01b0\u1edbc + ph\u1ea3i r\u1ed3i \u0111o\xe1n, sau \u0111\xf3 m\u1edbi xoay ki\u1ec3m tra."
f=l?"OLL: read the yellow shape on top first (dot, L, line, cross), then the yellow on the sides.":"OLL: nh\xecn h\xecnh v\xe0ng tr\xean m\u1eb7t tr\xean tr\u01b0\u1edbc (ch\u1ea5m, ch\u1eef L, \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng th\u1eb3ng, d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng), r\u1ed3i m\u1edbi xem m\xe0u v\xe0ng \u1edf m\u1eb7t b\xean."
h=A.a([h,g,f,l?"Practise: OLL/PLL recognition drill \u2013 build the longest correct streak you can.":"Luy\u1ec7n: Luy\u1ec7n nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n OLL/PLL \u2013 tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi \u0111\xfang li\xean ti\u1ebfp c\xe0ng nhi\u1ec1u c\xe0ng t\u1ed1t."],s)
l=$.c==="en"
g=l?"PLL + AUF: the U before and after":"PLL + AUF: xoay U tr\u01b0\u1edbc v\xe0 sau"
f=l?"Know straight away how to turn U before and after the PLL \u2013 no peeking turns.":"Bi\u1ebft ngay ph\u1ea3i xoay U th\u1ebf n\xe0o tr\u01b0\u1edbc v\xe0 sau PLL, kh\xf4ng ph\u1ea3i xoay th\u1eed."
e=l?"AUF (Adjust U Face) = turning the top to line it up. There are two: BEFORE the algorithm (put the case at its angle) and AFTER it (match the top layer to the rest).":"AUF (Adjust U Face) = xoay m\u1eb7t tr\xean cho kh\u1edbp. C\xf3 2 l\u1ea7n: TR\u01af\u1edaC c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c (\u0111\u1eb7t h\xecnh \u0111\xfang g\xf3c) v\xe0 SAU c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c (kh\u1edbp t\u1ea7ng tr\xean v\u1edbi 2 t\u1ea7ng d\u01b0\u1edbi)."
d=l?"Before: use the headlights and bars to see how far the case is from its standard angle, then turn U exactly once.":"Tr\u01b0\u1edbc: nh\xecn \u0111\xe8n pha v\xe0 d\u1ea3i m\xe0u \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft h\xecnh \u0111ang l\u1ec7ch bao nhi\xeau so v\u1edbi h\xecnh chu\u1ea9n, r\u1ed3i xoay U \u0111\xfang m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n."
c=l?"Example T-perm: the headlights must be on the LEFT. Headlights at the back \u2192 U'; on the right \u2192 U2; at the front \u2192 U.":"V\xed d\u1ee5 T-perm: \u0111\xe8n pha ph\u1ea3i \u1edf b\xean TR\xc1I. \u0110\xe8n pha \u1edf sau \u2192 U'; \u1edf ph\u1ea3i \u2192 U2; \u1edf tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u2192 U."
b=l?"After: when you recognise the PLL, note the front colour of the top layer \u2013 from it you can predict the final U before you finish.":"Sau: ngay l\xfac nh\u1eadn ra PLL, nh\u1edb m\xe0u m\u1eb7t tr\u01b0\u1edbc c\u1ee7a t\u1ea7ng tr\xean \u2013 t\u1eeb \u0111\xf3 \u0111o\xe1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c U cu\u1ed1i tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi l\xe0m xong c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c."
a=l?"H, Z, E, Na, Nb are symmetric: several angles work, pick the nearest.":"H, Z, E, Na, Nb \u0111\u1ed1i x\u1ee9ng: c\xf3 nhi\u1ec1u g\xf3c \u0111\xfang, ch\u1ecdn g\xf3c g\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5t."
e=A.a([e,d,c,b,a,l?'Practise: Recognition drill \u2192 PLL \u2192 turn on "Also ask the U turn".':'Luy\u1ec7n: Luy\u1ec7n nh\u1eadn d\u1ea1ng \u2192 PLL \u2192 b\u1eadt "H\u1ecfi c\u1ea3 xoay U".'],s)
l=A.a([new A.aZ("tperm",$.c==="en"?"T-perm (headlights on the left)":"T-perm (\u0111\xe8n pha b\xean tr\xe1i)","R U R' U' R' F R2 U' R' U' R U R' F'",""),B.vy,B.OL],k)
k=$.c==="en"
d=k?"Cancel moves & predict the last U":"G\u1ed9p b\u01b0\u1edbc & \u0111o\xe1n tr\u01b0\u1edbc U cu\u1ed1i"
c=k?"Remove wasted moves between algorithms and between OLL and PLL.":"B\u1ecf nh\u1eefng b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1eeba gi\u1eefa hai c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c v\xe0 gi\u1eefa OLL v\u1edbi PLL."
b=k?"If one algorithm ends on the same face the next begins, merge them: U then U \u2192 U2; R' then R \u2192 both cancel.":"C\xf4ng th\u1ee9c n\xe0y k\u1ebft th\xfac v\xe0 c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c sau b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u b\u1eb1ng c\xf9ng m\u1ed9t m\u1eb7t th\xec g\u1ed9p: U r\u1ed3i U \u2192 U2; R' r\u1ed3i R \u2192 b\u1ecf c\u1ea3 hai."
a=k?"During the last moves of OLL, watch the sides to recognise the PLL \u2013 no pause.":"Trong l\xfac l\xe0m v\xe0i b\u01b0\u1edbc cu\u1ed1i c\u1ee7a OLL, nh\xecn m\u1eb7t b\xean \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn ra PLL \u2013 kh\xf4ng d\u1eebng l\u1ea1i."
a0=k?"Predict the final U (AUF): once you know the PLL you also know how far off the top will be \u2013 do the last U without looking.":"\u0110o\xe1n tr\u01b0\u1edbc U cu\u1ed1i (AUF): khi nh\u1eadn ra PLL, \u0111\xe3 bi\u1ebft cube s\u1ebd l\u1ec7ch bao nhi\xeau sau \u0111\xf3 \u2013 l\xe0m U cu\u1ed1i ngay, kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n nh\xecn l\u1ea1i."
b=A.a([b,a,a0,k?"Keep your grip as long as possible: every regrip costs about 0.3 s.":"Gi\u1eef cube c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ebfn cu\u1ed1i c\xe0ng l\xe2u c\xe0ng t\u1ed1t: m\u1ed7i l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ed5i tay c\u1ea7m t\u1ed1n kho\u1ea3ng 0,3 gi\xe2y."],s)
k=$.c==="en"
a=k?"Slow turning":"Gi\u1ea3i ch\u1eadm kh\xf4ng d\u1eebng (slow turning)"
a0=k?"Train look-ahead by turning slowly but steadily, never stopping.":"Luy\u1ec7n nh\xecn tr\u01b0\u1edbc b\u1eb1ng c\xe1ch xoay ch\u1eadm m\xe0 \u0111\u1ec1u, kh\xf4ng bao gi\u1edd d\u1eebng tay."
a1=k?"Why does slowing down make you faster? Most time is lost in the PAUSES while you search for pieces, not in hand speed.":"V\xec sao ch\u1eadm l\u1ea1i gi\xfap nhanh h\u01a1n? Ph\u1ea7n l\u1edbn th\u1eddi gian m\u1ea5t \u1edf nh\u1eefng l\xfac D\u1eeaNG \u0111\u1ec3 t\xecm m\u1ea3nh, kh\xf4ng ph\u1ea3i \u1edf t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 tay."
a2=k?"How: turn at 50\u201370% speed so you always see the next piece in advance. If you have to stop, you're still too fast \u2013 slow down more.":"C\xe1ch t\u1eadp: xoay \u1edf t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 50\u201370%, sao cho l\xfac n\xe0o c\u0169ng th\u1ea5y tr\u01b0\u1edbc m\u1ea3nh ti\u1ebfp theo. Ph\u1ea3i d\u1eebng = v\u1eabn qu\xe1 nhanh, gi\u1ea3m t\u1ed1c ti\u1ebfp."
a3=k?"Focus on F2L: while inserting one pair, your eyes find the next.":"T\u1eadp ph\u1ea7n F2L l\xe0 ch\xednh: trong l\xfac ch\xe8n c\u1eb7p n\xe0y, m\u1eaft t\xecm c\u1eb7p ti\u1ebfp theo."
a4=k?"Use a metronome: one move per beat, starting around 1\u20132 moves per second (the Look-ahead metronome screen).":"D\xf9ng m\xe1y \u0111\u1ebfm nh\u1ecbp: m\u1ed7i nh\u1ecbp m\u1ed9t b\u01b0\u1edbc, b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u kho\u1ea3ng 1\u20132 b\u01b0\u1edbc/gi\xe2y (m\xe0n Nh\xecn tr\u01b0\u1edbc theo nh\u1ecbp)."
a1=A.a([a1,a2,a3,a4,k?"Do 5\u201310 slow solves a day before timing. After a few weeks your normal times usually drop.":"5\u201310 l\u01b0\u1ee3t ch\u1eadm m\u1ed7i ng\xe0y tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi b\u1ea5m gi\u1edd. Sau v\xe0i tu\u1ea7n, th\u1eddi gian b\xecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng th\u01b0\u1eddng gi\u1ea3m r\xf5."],s)
k=$.c==="en"
a2=k?"The road to sub-20":"L\u1ed9 tr\xecnh xu\u1ed1ng d\u01b0\u1edbi 20 gi\xe2y"
a3=k?"Know what to learn after 2-look, in the most useful order.":"Bi\u1ebft h\u1ecdc g\xec ti\u1ebfp theo sau 2-look, theo th\u1ee9 t\u1ef1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 nh\u1ea5t."
